5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m a bit nervous to start. I just want to make sure the room can actually handle whatever we bring in.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The room’s capacity is secondary. I want to know what audiences actually remember. Let’s look at the comment slips.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know who is actually working! The staff list is old. Who is standing in the room?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I’m worried about the delivery again. Last time we got stuck at the door. I want to check the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I suspect the invoices tell a truer story than the walls. I’ll check the loan transport costs over three seasons.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I’m still thinking about the floor. Maybe I should check the structural survey of the suspended bay?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I’ll also check the weekend head counts. Numbers don’t lie about who returns.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, numbers are cool, but I need to know who is actually doing the work! I’ll check the volunteer roster.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I’ll also check the maintenance log for powered displays. If they break, delivery is useless.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"And the mount-making charges. If the joiner’s rate spikes, the budget bleeds before the first visitor even arrives.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll check the structural survey of the suspended bay. I need to know if the floor can hold the weight before we promise anything.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I’ll check the five years of visitor comment slips. The record should get a hearing before we commit the main room again.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I’ll check the conservation lab staffing and backlog. If the lab is drowning, the whole plan collapses before opening day!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I’ll check the maintenance log for powered displays. If they break, delivery is useless.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I’ll check the mount-making charges and joiner’s rate. If the joiner’s rate spikes, the budget bleeds before the first visitor even arrives.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll also check the evening hire bookings. I need to know if the room is already spoken for before we add more weight.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
