77,3,4,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, I still worry about the empty lab, but Option A brings real people to the room! I vote for Option A.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, I agree. No shipping cut-offs, no breakdowns. Option A is the only one that won’t leave us apologising at the door. I vote for Option A.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
